==Distribution==
''Ferocactus macrodiscus'' is found in growing in Oak forest and grasslands [[San Luis Potosí]], [[Querétaro]], [[Guanajuato]], [[Puebla]] and [[Oaxaca]] states of Mexico at elevations of 2,300 to 2,600 meters.<ref name="Art 2013 s871">{{cite web | last=Art | first=Cactus | title=Ferocactus macrodiscus | website=
LLIFLE | date=2013-08-04 | url=http://www.llifle.com/Encyclopedia/CACTI/Family/Cactaceae/4317/Ferocactus_macrodiscus | access-date=2024-01-15}}{{Creative Commons text attribution notice|cc=bysa3|from this source=yes}}</ref>
